{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/af191d1f5f5a9c6c9aef819c43372a7e.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Hi,</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">I hope you&rsquo;re well! I&rsquo;m reaching out from&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">DENSE</strong>, the leaders in hair loss and regrowth brand, with a fantastic opportunity to collaborate. Given your influence in personal transformation, we believe you&rsquo;re the perfect partner to help shift the conversation around hair loss and mental health.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">The Offer<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">***50% on All Purchases***<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">As a premium ranged brand, this allows you to make significant income whilst helping so many gain confidence.&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Why DENSE Stands Out</strong></div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">At DENSE, we offer more than just hair products&mdash;we help people regain their confidence. Our treatments are personalised for each individual and formulated by top specialists. We address both the physical and emotional aspects of hair loss, empowering people to overcome the stigma and feel confident again.</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">The Power of Hair Confidence</strong></div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Research shows that&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">36% of people</strong>&nbsp;feel more confident after experiencing significant hair regrowth, which positively impacts their careers, relationships, and self-esteem. Hair loss can seriously affect confidence, but DENSE is here to change that story with real, lasting solutions.</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Our Approach: Personalised, Proven, Holistic</strong></div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Our&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Bespoke All-in-One Topical Spray</strong>&nbsp;combines&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">minoxidil</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">finasteride</strong>, delivering effective results without the side effects of oral treatments. Using natural ingredients like&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Curcuma Longa</strong>, which reduces hair loss by&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">up to 89%</strong>, our treatments promote long-term regrowth while prioritising overall health.</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Why Collaborate with Us?</strong></div>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Authenticity:</strong>&nbsp;We&rsquo;ve helped over&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">20,000 people</strong>&nbsp;rediscover their hair confidence.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Risk-Free Results:</strong>&nbsp;Our 90- and 150-day money-back guarantees ensure complete peace of mind.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">Mental Health Focus:</strong>&nbsp;We&rsquo;re tackling the stigma of hair loss and promoting self-acceptance and positive change.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Join us in challenging outdated beauty standards and empowering people to feel their best. Let&rsquo;s connect and discuss how we can make a real difference together!</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Best regards,<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">DENSE Hair Experts</strong></div>",
